 ## Implemented
 
 ### Controller & Integration
+- The controller passes the terminal speed cap into the optimizer as well as the output taper.
+  `trajectory.terminal_time_weight_scale` can reduce time pressure during final approach.
+  Once both Nav2 pose tolerances hold, it commands braking and lets the goal checker verify
+  measured stopping. Telemetry records the measured start velocity and effective optimizer limits.
 - TEBController plugin lifecycle (configure/activate/deactivate/cleanup) + `setPlan`,
   `computeVelocityCommands`, `setSpeedLimit`
+- Same-goal global replans preserve warm starts only while their geometric deviation remains below
+  `trajectory.reinit_path_dist`; Nav2 percentage and absolute speed limits are applied proportionally
+  to linear, reverse and angular command saturation.
 - Costmap converter integration (obstacle polygons for visualization/obstacles)
 - Parameter library via `generate_parameter_library` (schema =
   `config/teb_controller_parameters.yaml`; doc/parameters.md auto-generated via `make docs`)
 - TEBVisualizer: 7 RViz topics (local plan, lookahead, poses, obstacles, curvature radii, footprint)
 
 ### Trajectory Optimization (g2o)
-- 27 custom g2o edge classes + 2 vertex types (21 wired in `buildGraph`; acceleration/jerk/steering-rate
+- 27 custom g2o edge classes + 2 vertex types (22 wired in `buildGraph`; acceleration/jerk/steering-rate
   Start+Goal variants)
+- `EdgeViaPoint` references every intermediate band pose to its closest projection on the latest
